9,"Gurage, West in Ethiopia people group profile | Joshua Project",https://joshuaproject.net/people_groups/15917/ET,"The Gurage people's ancestors were military conquers from the Aksumite Empire. They originated in the Tigray region. The Gurage people have subgroups, one of which is the West Gurage. The West Gurage speak Sebat Bet Gurage.",Sebat Bet Gurage,Afro-Asiatic
